# Dack Fayden's emblem: "gain control of those permanents" - all of them, as they are when the ability resolves. Bot1
# casts Fire Covenant (X = 2) at Bot2's Concealing Curtains and Ornithopter, 1 damage each. With the emblem's ability
# on the stack Bot2 exiles its own Ornithopter with Swords to Plowshares: the ability takes only the Curtains. The
# Covenant then deals its 1 damage to the Curtains (now Bot1's, still alive); the Ornithopter is no longer a legal target.

